mutant: m067_hot_batch_seq_check_skipped
target: internal/catalog/scripts.go
failure-mode: |
  CommitHotBatches no longer locks and checks the seq key against the batch's
  first seq (design §10.2). A leader whose in-memory seq diverged from the
  catalog would commit a batch that overlaps or skips the committed range,
  and the script overwrites the seq key anyway.
expected-detection: |
  Correct leaders never diverge, so the layer 3 oracle has no path that
  reaches this check. TestScripts_SeqMismatch commits a batch at the wrong
  first seq and requires SourceSeq corruption.
expected-tier: disagg
tiers: disagg

